  <History Date="01-09-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Red 1, Green 1, Blue 1 attributes and replaced first cell in multi-cell modes." />
  <History Date="01-09-11" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Fixed power on and locate.  Added pixel mapper compatibility." />
  <History Date="11-02-14" Author="RGB Power on Updater" Comment="Updated RGB Power on values to match Locate." />
